abstract: >-
  A human-in-the-loop workflow for computational chemistry and materials
  modeling that supports progressive scientific intake, a fixed final browser
  review, minimal calculation-file preparation, controlled PowerShell 7,
  evidence-oriented result analysis, and manuscript drafting from actual records.
